 Slogo（1,170 萬訂閱者）推薦！</h3><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uoBKZZFl-mo\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<h2>操作方式</h2>\n<p><code>/meccha</code> 開啟選單。<strong>R</strong> 姿勢輪盤 · <strong>F</strong> 塗裝 · <strong>G</strong> 哨音 · <strong>Esc</strong> 離開 · <strong>蹲下 + 空白鍵</strong> 攀爬牆壁</p>\n<h2>圖庫</h2>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fZRNfF6Hv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Q7XJTF8h/supports-shaders.png\" alt=\"支援光影！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fbMx6gZvM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nNTwsv1N/meccha-gravel.png\" alt=\"我是一顆碎石！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fyC3LhG2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XPwmyNH/meccha-sunset.png\" alt=\"哇，夕陽真美！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fTB0Htjq8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z6ghx418/screen-meccha2.png\" alt=\"我們可以疊在一起！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>完整可玩，體驗流暢。</strong> 塗裝、姿勢、房間與捉迷藏功能目前均已實裝，且每個版本都會新增功能與優化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><em>致敬 lemorion_1224 的作品《Meccha Chameleon》之粉絲作品，並非官方合作。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f4704690%252fMECCHA_CHAMELEON%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">快去玩原版吧！</a> 霰彈槍模型與貼圖由 <strong>ECYsh364</strong> 提供（GWR3D 資源包）。</em></p>\n<hr>\n<p>有任何問題、想法，或想合作？<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord</a></strong> · 透過 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252faminoquiz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ko-fi.com/aminoquiz</a></strong> 支持我們。</p>\n<p>沒有伺服器？透過<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com